<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pendŭlus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		pendeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>hanging</i>, <i>hanging down</i>, <i>pendent</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-Aug. prose; syn.: pensilis). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 3, 27, 59</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">libra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					4, 386</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palearia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					7, 117</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tela,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. H.
					1, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genae (ebrii),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 22, 28, § 142</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of places, <i>overhanging</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 13, 112</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loca et macriora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 2,
					18</span></i>
			.—Of persons, <i>hanging</i>, <i>swinging</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">putator arbustis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					10, 229</span></i>
			.—In mal. part.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Venus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 122 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>doubtful</i>, <i>uncertain</i>, <i>hesitating</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">neu fluitem dubiae spe pendulus horae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 18, 110</span></i>
			; Hadrian. ap. <i><span class="en">Vop. Saturn.
		8</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
